ght on trackpads.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619075043/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619764023","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113646#issuecomment-3619764023","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113646","id":3619764023,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XwTc3","user":{"login":"eobet","id":3254196,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTQxOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3254196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet","html_url":"https://github.com/eobet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-06T08:48:58Z","updated_at":"2025-12-06T09:01:03Z","body":"I don't use Firefox but I just downloaded it to test and I can confirm that I can scroll horizontally on their tabs using two-finger swipe. Both left and right and up and down two finger movements work, so I guess one of that is regular vertical scrolling and the other is a gesture and Firefox happen to support both? I can get neither to work in Godot.\n\nI'm using Gnome, but I don't think that would be an issue?\n\nWhen I raised this issue in the official Godot rocket chat #editor-design channel, someone else tested this on MacOS and claimed it was not working for them either.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3619764023/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3620460141","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113646#issuecomment-3620460141","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113646","id":3620460141,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Xy9Zt","user":{"login":"FifthTundraG","id":117035030,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvnQFg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117035030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG","html_url":"https://github.com/FifthTundraG","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-06T14:29:05Z","updated_at":"2025-12-06T14:29:05Z","body":"This might not actually be a new problem, there was some relevant discourse in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13206 regarding this bug on macOS specifically.\n\nMy mind goes to this being a hardware issue, the trackpads on Apple devices and on your laptop not using the scrolling hardware calls we expect, but if it works in Firefox then they must be doing something that we're not.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3620460141/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3620509470","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113646#issuecomment-3620509470","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113646","id":3620509470,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XzJce","user":{"login":"FifthTundraG","id":117035030,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvnQFg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117035030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG","html_url":"https://github.com/FifthTundraG","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FifthTundraG/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-06T14:49:10Z","updated_at":"2025-12-06T15:12:26Z","body":"Found something!\n\nScrolling up/down or left/right with my trackpad on `TabBar` is not working for me when I enable `run/platforms/linuxbsd/prefer_wayland`. Mouse wheel up/down does work to scroll on it though. I can also scroll in the node list and script editor with my trackpad or mouse perfectly fine. We must be doing something with `TabBar` scrolling that only works on X11/XWayland. I can't speak for macOS but I would assume it's a similar case there.\n\nEDIT: I also cannot use my trackpad at all for `H/VScrollBar` nodes in a game","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3620509470/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3620560308","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113646#issuecomment-3620560308","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113646","id":3620560308,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XzV20","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-06T15:18:36Z","updated_at":"2025-12-06T15:18:36Z","body":"From the comments, it seems like Wayland (and mac?) don't send `MouseButton::WHEEL_LEFT` etc for gestures.\nSome controls handle `InputEventPanGesture` themselves, it should be possible to fix by handling this in TabBar.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3620560308/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3621885830","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113646#issuecomment-3621885830","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113646","id":3621885830,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7X4ZeG","user":{"login":"eobet","id":3254196,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTQxOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3254196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet","html_url":"https://github.com/eobet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eobet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-07T10:13:05Z","updated_at":"2025-12-07T10:13:05Z","body":"If it has to be fixed via a gesture in Wayland, maybe it's worth mentioning this issue which continues to be very problematic:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/i